</div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rs-index="23" data-index="23" data-testid="transcript-row" data-perf-row="assistant" data-perf-row-from-tail="4" data-perf-row-streaming="false" style="display: flow-root; position: relative;"><div role="article" tabindex="-1" class="rounded-lg focus-visible:shadow-focus focus-visible:outline-hidden" aria-setsize="28" aria-posinset="24" aria-label="Message 24 of 28"><div data-test-render-count="1"><div class="group group/message-row"><div class="contents"><div class="group relative relative pb-[var(--msg-assistant-pb,0.75rem)]" style="" data-is-streaming="false"><h2 data-find-omitted="" class="sr-only select-none">Claude responded: Images can help — especially for a security blog where the flow of an exploit is often easier to follow visually than in prose.</h2><div class="font-claude-response relative leading-[1.65rem] [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:bg-bg-000/50 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-0.5 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-border-400 [&amp;_.ignore-pre-bg&gt;div]:bg-transparent [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-[var(--msg-text-inset,0.5rem)] [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-[var(--msg-text-inset,0.5rem)] [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8 [&amp;_.md-table-scroll]:pl-[var(--msg-block-inset,0.5rem)] [&amp;_.md-table-scroll]:pr-[var(--msg-inset-end,0.5rem)]"><div><div class="grid grid-rows-[auto_auto] min-w-0"><div class="row-start-1 col-start-1 min-w-0"><div data-find-omitted="" class="contents"><div class="min-w-0 [--msg-block-radius:initial] ps-[var(--msg-text-inset,0.5rem)] mb-sm py-[var(--msg-pill-py,0.375rem)]"><div data-closed="" data-cds="TurnStatus" data-testid="TurnStatus" data-state="done" class="group/status flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col ps-[var(--cds-assistant-message-text-inset,0px)]"><div data-cds-row="" class="flex min-w-0 gap-xs text-start font-sans text-body items-center py-[calc((var(--cds-h-control)_-_1lh)_/_2)] mx-outset w-stretch px-xs relative isolate rounded select-none" style="--cds-outset-x: var(--cds-pad-xs);"><span id="_r_1dd_-text" class="flex min-w-0 gap-xs items-center"><span id="_r_1dd_-label" class="flex min-w-0 items-center"><span class="group/morph inline-grid items-center justify-items-start data-[gliding]:overflow-x-clip min-w-0 max-w-full"><span data-morph-key="done|Thought for 5s" class="col-start-1 row-start-1 flex min-w-0 max-w-full items-center group-data-[gliding]/morph:max-w-none"><span class="min-w-0 truncate text-muted group-hover/status:text-secondary group-has-[:focus-visible]/status:text-secondary"><bdi>Thought for 5s</bdi></span></span></span></span></span><button type="button" data-cds-row-toggle="" class="cds-reset -ms-1 inline-flex h-[1lh] shrink-0 items-center justify-center self-start border-0 bg-transparent p-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden static after:absolute after:inset-0 after:rounded after:content-[&#39;&#39;] after:transition-shadow after:duration-fast focus-visible:after:shadow-focus" tabindex="0" aria-disabled="false" aria-expanded="false" aria-labelledby="_r_1dd_-label" fdprocessedid="516uyn"><span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-flex h-[1lh] items-center justify-center text-muted transition-transform duration-fast motion-reduce:transition-none group-hover/status:text-secondary group-has-[:focus-visible]/status:text-secondary"><span data-cds="Icon" aria-hidden="true" style="font-family: var(--font-anthropicons, Anthropicons-Variable); font-feature-settings: &quot;liga&quot; 0; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-style: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; line-height: 1; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; user-select: none; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 577.8;"></span></span></button></div><span class="sr-only" role="status" aria-live="polite">Thought for 5s</span></div></div></div></div><div class="row-start-2 col-start-1 relative grid grid-rows-[auto_auto] isolate min-w-0"><div class="row-start-1 col-start-1 relative z-[2] min-w-0"><div style=""><div data-cds="Prose" class="prose" style="--_prose-font-body: var(--font-claude-response, var(--cds-font-voice));"><div class="_blocks_fp3b6_47 standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 whitespace-normal break-words print:block standard-markdown"><p dir="ltr">Images can help — especially for a security blog where the flow of an exploit is often easier to follow visually than in prose. A few options depending on what you want:</p>
<ol dir="ltr">
<li><strong>A flowchart version of the TOCTOU race</strong> (like the one in your uploaded image) — I could recreate that as a Mermaid flowchart alongside the sequence diagram, showing the two parallel branches merging into the "$200 withdrawn, $0 left" result.</li>
<li><strong>Diagrams for the other vulnerable code sections</strong> — e.g. a simple flow for the IDOR order-cancellation bug (attacker → server → no ownership check → order cancelled), or the SSRF one (attacker → server → internal metadata endpoint).</li>
<li><strong>Plain illustrative images</strong> (like the server-rack photo in your upload) — these are more decorative than explanatory; I can source relevant stock-style images if you want visual breaks between sections, but they don't add technical understanding the way a diagram does.</li>
</ol>
<p dir="ltr">For a technical blog like this, I'd lean toward diagrams over decorative images — they actually explain the mechanism rather than just breaking up text.</p>
<p dir="ltr">Want me to add a Mermaid flowchart (matching your uploaded image's structure) into the race condition section, and/or a small diagram for each of the 5 vulnerable code patterns?</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-cds="MessageActions" data-reveal="fade" role="toolbar" aria-label="Message actions" data-size="xs" tabindex="-1" class="flex items-center select-none [&amp;_button]:text-muted [&amp;_button:hover:not([aria-pressed=true])]:text-primary ml-[calc(var(--msg-text-inset,0.5rem)_-_0.375rem)] -mt-1"><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0" aria-label="Copy" data-testid="action-bar-copy" id="_r_1e9_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger="" fdprocessedid="thhae" tabindex="0"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent "></