<h2 dir="ltr" class="mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold break-words" data-sourcepos="25:1-25:20;1053-1072">1. Prerequisites</h2>

<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal" dir="ltr" data-sourcepos="27:1-27:64;1074-1137">To get the most out of this post, it helps to be familiar with:</p>

<ul dir="ltr" class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1" data-sourcepos="29:1-34:18;1139-1291">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2" data-sourcepos="29:1-29:22;1139-1160">Python fundamentals</li>
